flowchart TD
User["**User**<br/>Starts optimization run"]
NSGA2Algorithm["**NSGA2Algorithm**<br/>Config<br/>pop_size user settable<br/>n_gen user settable<br/>Operators sampling crossover mutation<br/>Method<br/>minimize BufferCapacityProblem"]
BufferCapacityProblem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Attributes<br/>n_var 6<br/>xl vector {1-10}<br/>xu vector {1-10}<br/>n_replications replication count<br/>base_seed random seed<br/>Method<br/>_evaluate batch evaluate individuals"]
InputVariables["**Input Variables**<br/>Buffer capacities caps 6 integers {1-10}"]
MultiprocessingPool["**MultiprocessingPool**<br/>Parallel workers n_cores<br/>Maps tasks to workers using pool map"]
Evaluator["**Evaluator**<br/>evaluate_single_individual<br/>Converts genotype to caps<br/>Runs n replications sequentially<br/>Averages wip and throughput"]
SimulationRunner["**SimulationRunner**<br/>run_simulation_with_caps<br/>Constructs buffers with caps<br/>Creates machines and processes<br/>Runs warmup and measurement<br/>Returns metrics overall throughput and wip"]
DelayBufferClass["**DelayBuffer**<br/>Attributes cap delay tokens store<br/>Methods put get free_capacity in_transit_count"]
MachineClass["**Machine**<br/>Attributes name input_buffer output_buffer process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power capacity<br/>Methods run waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption"]
MetricsCollector["**MetricsCollector**<br/>Aggregates replication results<br/>Computes average wip and average throughput<br/>Forms objective vector [wip negative throughput]"]
Objectives["**Objectives**<br/>Minimize wip<br/>Maximize throughput"]
NSGA2Archive["**NSGA2Archive**<br/>Maintains population and history<br/>Receives objective vectors and updates population"]
Exporter["**Exporter**<br/>export_history_to_csv<br/>Serializes history to results CSV"]
CSVFile["**CSVFile**<br/>Stored optimization history<br/>Fields generation individual caps wip throughput"]

User --> NSGA2Algorithm
NSGA2Algorithm --> BufferCapacityProblem
BufferCapacityProblem --> InputVariables
BufferCapacityProblem --> MultiprocessingPool
MultiprocessingPool --> Evaluator
Evaluator --> SimulationRunner
SimulationRunner --> DelayBufferClass
SimulationRunner --> MachineClass
SimulationRunner --> MetricsCollector
MetricsCollector --> Objectives
MetricsCollector --> NSGA2Archive
Objectives --> NSGA2Archive
NSGA2Archive --> NSGA2Algorithm
NSGA2Algorithm --> Exporter
Exporter --> CSVFile